  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "GitLab is a single application for source control, CI/CD, security, and (on higher tiers) DevSecOps. SaaS Free covers small private namespaces with CI minute/storage caps. Premium is $29/user/month billed annually (no true month-to-month on paid). Ultimate is listed as custom/contact on GitLab’s current pricing page (historically $99/user/mo — confirm live). Self-managed SKUs exist separately. Distinct from GitHub (source-control cluster peer) and from GitHub Copilot (AI coding product).",
    "bestFor": [
      "Teams that want git + CI + security in one licence",
      "Self-managed / data-residency buyers",
      "Orgs leaving a many-tool DevOps stack",
      "small-business / engineering: GitLab fit for small-business engineering teams in the source-control-devops job cluster, from first-party positioning and IT Priority-2 research.",
